    "how_to_hash": "Record hashes: convert each listed field to a string, in that order. Use the JSON number text returned by the API. Treat JSON null or an empty CSV cell as an empty string. Join the strings with | and hash the UTF-8 bytes with SHA-256.",
    "how_to_hash_field": "Field hashes: SHA-256 of record_id|field_name|value, using the same string rules. Compare each field with field_hashes in /api/integrity. A mismatch names the value that changed. Duplicates still match every hash; find those by counting player_id and session_id pairs.",
